<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-10-19T11:00:49.170Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 11:00:49 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iranian-backed militias in Iraq suffered a mysterious explosion that struck a group linked to Iran, while the Popular Mobilization Forces confirmed Al-Fayyadh remains chairman despite disputed vice-presidency claims. Iran’s envoy in Baghdad warned that security of the Iran-Iraq border is Tehran’s red line and Iranian forces attacked the Komala Kurdish opposition group in Iraq. In northern Iraq a power struggle in Nineveh delayed Sinjar administrative appointments, and the Kurdistan Regional Government warned that a coalition exit could enable an ISIS resurgence. The conflict recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxPSmNrWTFFN2lLR1VlNkozckJlRlZzQVlHVFA4NEpFaEJkOE1BS2NvVDl5UW01MUc5Unp3U1dVWTU4XzVlNFFQdmVORm1DVEYzYzBkeEgtMHdpLVc0SVBGQl9JeWtoU2VNbVNudzZ0dDdMZ0RxQjJpdHlCanpXeFEtUDBhZVN1WlM4VlkyTHA3TldNZEhReXZudXVBR2dRWkh3eFJNdFhDLXhYQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Euronews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxNZThpNUo0MkZfaDFZcllJSS1scDhieGJ4eDZXRkYzcUs2ekNpeUpkTUd0T3BBSWxRMll6elNRNElheV9hLUpaSHdvRjBMY2dtT3ZrcGVFa3hBX2FwMkZPUFNuUEE3N0MxamZGQTBCdC1UMHM1bWZwUjB5d21sd1YzajRPeF9HVExyRmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;وكالة الانباء العراقية (واع)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxPT2ZVa2pvdVBxak03SEQ2ZEFtVUZnbHg1TTQzaFFXLUpBaVhfZ2EtN2JucFVqeHZ0cWpkc0hzcEpwblhTTEdFRGlJLThRN2M0QklwUExvbWg2LWRWWWxIR1ZUN0h2MHlqTUNZYjVuUWVDdmRaTWZXZ3dnck8wRlFzOFM3R2l6dUs3NXBqM0ttdlRMeFo3cEF4WTBnSGNaSHhkR1FvZ3NtU0pyZjZCS2NyQUpybVlHUU1yemc?oc=5&quot;&gt;وكالة الانباء العراقية (واع)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxNVDJodjgtWHhpUzVtbVJRRTNQYm5fVHN6eG1fZThjanprUDhOOHZPOXpleXR